-- title:
--   The uniform prog_il for a rational circuit
-- statement:
--   **The uniform `prog_il` for a rational circuit.**  The single procedure `progU (Qc.toCircuit 1) (edgeTplQ Qc)` and the constants depend only on `Qc`; for every prime `q`, every exponent `b` with `m ^ j ≤ b` for the levels `j < k`, it computes the procedure `prog` of the circuit `Qc.toCircuit (q ^ b)` (Lemma 10 factorizations `facD (q ^ b)`), provided the frame matrices are good at `q` (`GoodAtQ`) and the bit size `Bb` fits the template controls (`TOK`, `SubBnd`).
--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.KIL5Main`):
--
--   ```lean
