--
--   **Context.** The lemma belongs to the part *KIL5: the uniform `prog_il`*: `progU_run`: the single fixed procedure `progU C tpl` (KIL5Prog; it depends only on the circuit
--   `C` and the template function `tpl`) computes `prog C q k P L A B Cs` at every level `k`, for
--   every `q`, `P`, `L`, `A`, `B`, `Cs` and input, from any state carrying the descriptor
